<section class=\"butter-band\"><div class=\"container split\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">A BIGGER TABLE</p><h2>Good things<br>are for sharing.</h2><p>Weekend boxes are a lovely place to start. For a gathering, our sample catering menu offers sliced country loaves, rosemary focaccia and trays of honey buns for 8–30 guests.</p><p>Plan at least three days ahead. Final quantities, ingredients and availability would be agreed with the bakery before any real order.</p><?php hearth_honey_link( '/contact/#inquiry', 'Ask about catering ↗', 'button' ); ?></div><?php get_template_part( 'template-parts/content', 'single-service-highlight' ); ?></div></section>
<section class=\"container narrow inner-section\"><h2>A few things to know.</h2><details><summary>Which allergens are in the bakes?</summary><p>All breads contain wheat. Seeded loaves also contain sesame. Honey buns contain wheat, milk and egg; honey butter contains milk. Everything shares a preparation space, so this sample menu cannot promise an allergen-free product.</p></details><details><summary>Can I reserve a loaf?</summary><p>This sample site does not take reservations. At a real bakery, check availability directly before making a special trip. Fresh loaves are best collected early.</p></details><details><summary>Is sourdough gluten-free?</summary><p>No. Our sample sourdough uses wheat flour and contains gluten. Slow fermentation does not make it gluten-free.</p></details></section>
