.\README.md:1:# Northstar Websites WordPress Theme
.\README.md:3:Northstar Websites is a modern service-business WordPress theme for website design, build, support, work examples, resources, contact forms, and newsletter signup.
.\template-parts\content-policy.php:1:<article class="container narrow policy inner-section"><p class="eyebrow">HEARTH &amp; HONEY</p><h1>Privacy &amp; demo details.</h1><p>This website presents a fictional neighborhood bakery. It does not take orders, payments or reservations.</p><h2>The inquiry demo</h2><p>Fields on the contact page are demonstration controls. The demo button shows an on-page explanation only. The theme does not send field contents to a server, save them in a database, email them, or store them in your browser. Please use sample information.</p><h2>Cookies and third parties</h2><p>The theme adds no analytics, tracking scripts, remote fonts or marketing cookies. WordPress, hosting services and any separately installed plugins may handle technical logs or cookies independently. A site operator must describe those services before using this theme for a real business.</p><h2>Photographs and links</h2><p>Approved stock photographs are served from this theme. Attribution links lead to Unsplash; visiting those links takes you to a third-party website with its own policies. The photographs do not depict products made by this fictional brand.</p><h2>Before a real launch</h2><p>Replace the sample address, hours, pricing and email, review ingredient and allergen information, and provide an accurate privacy policy for the actual operator and any real form service.</p><?php hearth_honey_link( '/', 'Back to the bakery ↗', 'button' ); ?></article>

