# Getting Started

Install the theme in WordPress, activate it, then create pages for Home, About, Services, Work, Blog, Contact, and Policy content. Assign the homepage to use `front-page.php`, apply the included page templates where appropriate, and configure Primary and Footer menus.

Run `npm install` when dependencies are not present, then use `npm run build` to regenerate `assets/css/bundle.css` and `assets/js/bundle.js`.

# Blocks

This theme does not ship custom block registrations. The folder is reserved for future block documentation and should stay separate from template parts, page templates, and compiled assets.

License

This generated WordPress theme is provided for use within the Nolan Young Theme Factory workflow. Third-party assets, if added later, must retain their own documented license terms.


